WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.019
Today we will recognise pulse and respectful listening. Our work connects with our

00:00:05.019 --> 00:00:06.131
own local community.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.150
Listen to a short local rhythm and count its pulses.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.681
Echo the pulse by tapping softly four times.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.257
Perform the pulse with a partner, starting and stopping together.
